  "evidence": [
    "Every START_SECTION of NoopMSDataConsumer_test.cpp, MSDataStoringConsumer_test.cpp, MSDataTransformingConsumer_test.cpp, MSDataChainingConsumer_test.cpp, MSDataAggregatingConsumer_test.cpp and IndexedMzMLFileLoader_test.cpp is transcribed with its line numbers (source review, tier 3). No C++ was executed.",
    "MSDataSqlConsumer has no upstream class test; tests/ms_data_sql_consumer.rs derives every expectation from MSDataSqlConsumer.cpp, the central one being that streamed records read back identically to MzMLSqliteHandler::write_experiment of the same experiment (tier 4).",
    "IndexedMzMLFileLoader_test.cpp's VALIDATE_TMP_FILES step runs under the mzml-schema feature (libxml2 XSD validation of both written files)."
  ],
  "gaps": [
    "MSDataAggregatingConsumer merges with a caller-supplied function: the source's SpectrumAddition::addUpSpectra(s_list, -1, true) (ANALYSIS/OPENSWATH/SpectrumAddition.h) is unported, and format may not depend on analysis. Its class test's 17/120/230 run with a merge double that adds intensities on the shared m/z grid.",
    "MSDataCachedConsumer is not ported: it needs CachedMzMLHandler's writeSpectrum_/writeChromatogram_ (FORMAT/HANDLERS/CachedMzMLHandler.h, unported).",
    "No tier 1 differential: no C++ oracle was run for these consumers.",
    "This manifest is not listed in SOURCE_PROVENANCE.json; registering it is the integrator's step."
  ]
